---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT_LINKS } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Refund & Cancellation"
  description="Refund and cancellation terms for Nirvigna. The website does not take payments."
  lastUpdated="8 October 2026"
>
  <h2>1. No payments on this website</h2>
  <p>This website does not sell anything and does not accept payments. Using the contact form or booking a demo is free.</p>

  <h2>2. Paid services</h2>
  <p>
    If you later engage {COMPANY.brand} for a paid service, the price, what is included, and the refund and cancellation terms will
    be set out in writing before you pay. Those written terms will apply to that service.
  </p>
  <p><Placeholder text="[PLACEHOLDER: standard refund and cancellation terms for paid services]" /></p>

  <h2>3. Fees paid to authorities and professionals</h2>
  <p>
    Government fees and fees charged by a qualified CA/CS for regulated filings are set by those authorities and professionals.
    Whether they can be refunded depends on their own rules.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about payments or cancellations: <a href={CONTACT_LINKS.email}>{COMPANY.email}</a>, {COMPANY.phoneDisplay}.</p>
</LegalLayout>
